---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import ProductImage from './assets/High-Earner-Checklist.png'

const checklistLink = '#contactform'
---
<section class="bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid gap-12 py-16 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:py-28">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="mb-7 text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#FFBD40]">
        High-Earners Clarity Checklist
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4rem)] font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight max-w-[11ch]">
        Are You Earning Well But Not Seeing the Wealth to Match?
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[38rem] text-lg leading-8 text-white/75 sm:text-xl">
        Discover the 10 strategic gaps holding back even the smartest professionals and what to do instead.
      </p>
      <a
        href={checklistLink}
        class="mt-9 inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD40] px-7 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-black hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true">🎯</span> Get the Free Checklist
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[32rem]">
      <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-[2rem] border border-[#FFBD40]/40" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white p-4 shadow-2xl">
        <Image
          src={ProductImage}
          alt="The High-Earners Clarity Checklist cover"
          class="block aspect-square w-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-3 rounded-xl bg-[#FFBD40] px-5 py-4 text-black shadow-xl sm:-left-8">
        <span class="block text-3xl font-bold leading-none">10</span>
        <span class="mt-1 block text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">strategic gaps</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid gap-10 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20">
    <div>
      <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-black/50">01</p>
      <h2 class="mt-5 max-w-[10ch] text-5xl font-bold leading-[0.95] sm:text-6xl text-black">
        You Are Not Alone And You Are Not Failing.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0 max-w-[46rem] text-lg leading-8 text-black/75 sm:text-xl">
      <p>You're ticking the boxes: good income, maybe even promotions, a few investments, a decent lifestyle.</p>
      <p class="mt-7">But behind the scenes,</p>
      <p class="mt-1">there's a nagging feeling:</p>
      <div class="my-10 grid gap-5 border-y border-black/15 py-8">
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#FFBD40] pl-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl text-black">
          "Why don't I feel financially secure?"
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-black pl-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl text-black">
          "Am I actually building wealth, or just coasting?"
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <p>The truth? Most professionals don't need more hustle.</p>
      <p class="mt-7">They need more clarity and a smarter way to use the money they already earn.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
